差异条数: 2
  /main_scene[0]/sub_scene[0]/scene_isp30/bayertnr_v2/TuningPara/enable    collect=0  demo=1
  /main_scene[1]/sub_scene[0]/scene_isp30/bayertnr_v2/TuningPara/enable    collect=0  demo=1
